#. type: Yaml Front Matter Hash Value: description
#, no-wrap
msgid ""
"How to use a virtual private endpoint to privately connect to IBM Quantum "
"Platform."
msgstr ""
"Cómo usar un endpoint privado virtual para conectarse de forma privada a IBM"
" Quantum Platform."

#. type: Yaml Front Matter Hash Value: title
#, no-wrap
msgid ""
"Use virtual private endpoints for VPC to privately connect to IBM Quantum "
"Platform"
msgstr ""
"Usar endpoints privados virtuales para VPC y conectarse de forma privada a "
"IBM Quantum Platform"

#. type: Plain text
#, markdown-text, no-wrap
msgid "{/* cspell:ignore FDQN */}\n"
msgstr "{/* cspell:ignore FDQN */}\n"

#. type: Title #
#, markdown-text, no-wrap
msgid ""
"Use virtual private endpoints for VPC to privately connect to IBM Quantum "
"Platform {#use-virtual-private-endpoints-for-vpc-to-privately-connect-to-"
"ibm-quantum-platform}"
msgstr ""
"Usar endpoints privados virtuales para VPC y conectarse de forma privada a "
"IBM Quantum Platform {#use-virtual-private-endpoints-for-vpc-to-privately-"
"connect-to-ibm-quantum-platform}"

#. type: Plain text
#, markdown-text, no-wrap
msgid ""
"Use Virtual Private Endpoints (VPE) for VPC to connect to IBM Quantum&reg; "
"from your VPC network by using IP address that you specify, allocated from a"
" subnet within your VPC.\n"
msgstr ""
"Usa los Endpoints Privados Virtuales (VPE) para VPC y conéctate a IBM "
"Quantum&reg; desde tu red VPC mediante una dirección IP que tú especifiques,"
" asignada desde una subred dentro de tu VPC.\n"

#. type: Plain text
#, markdown-text, no-wrap
msgid ""
"VPEs are virtual IP interfaces that are bound to an endpoint gateway created"
" on a per-service basis. The endpoint gateway is a virtualized function that"
" scales horizontally, is redundant and highly available, and spans all "
"availability zones of your VPC. Endpoint gateways enable communications from"
" virtual server instances within your VPC and IBM Cloud&reg; service on the "
"private backbone. VPE for VPC lets you control all private addressing within"
" your cloud. For more information, see [About virtual private endpoint "
"gateways](https://cloud.ibm.com/docs/vpc?topic=vpc-about-vpe).\n"
msgstr ""
"Los VPE son interfaces IP virtuales que están vinculadas a un gateway de "
"endpoint creado por servicio. El gateway de endpoint es una función "
"virtualizada que escala horizontalmente, es redundante y de alta "
"disponibilidad, y abarca todas las zonas de disponibilidad de tu VPC. Los "
"gateways de endpoint permiten las comunicaciones entre las instancias de "
"servidor virtual dentro de tu VPC y el servicio IBM Cloud&reg; sobre la red "
"troncal privada. VPE para VPC te permite controlar todo el direccionamiento "
"privado dentro de tu nube. Para obtener más información, consulta [Acerca de"
" los gateways de endpoint privado "
"virtual](https://cloud.ibm.com/docs/vpc?topic=vpc-about-vpe).\n"

#. type: Plain text
#, markdown-text, no-wrap
msgid ""
"Within IBM Quantum Platform, all customer data is transmitted over the "
"private network regardless of whether it is accessed through a public "
"endpoint or VPE.\n"
msgstr ""
"Dentro de IBM Quantum Platform, todos los datos de los clientes se "
"transmiten a través de la red privada independientemente de si se accede a "
"través de un endpoint público o VPE.\n"

#. type: Plain text
#, markdown-text, no-wrap
msgid ""
"Connecting to IBM Quantum Platform through the public endpoints transmits "
"all request and response data over the public internet. To connect to IBM "
"Quantum Platform by using a VPE, you must use the IBM Quantum Platform API "
"or SDK. IBM Quantum Platform can only be accessed through the public "
"network.\n"
msgstr ""
"La conexión a IBM Quantum Platform a través de los endpoints públicos "
"transmite todos los datos de solicitud y respuesta por internet público. "
"Para conectarte a IBM Quantum Platform mediante un VPE, debes usar la API o "
"el SDK de IBM Quantum Platform. IBM Quantum Platform solo es accesible a "
"través de la red pública.\n"

#. type: Title ##
#, markdown-text, no-wrap
msgid "Before you begin {#before-you-begin}"
msgstr "Antes de comenzar {#before-you-begin}"

#. type: Plain text
#, markdown-text, no-wrap
msgid ""
"Before you target a VPE for IBM Quantum Platform, complete the following "
"steps:\n"
msgstr ""
"Antes de apuntar a un VPE para IBM Quantum Platform, completa los siguientes"
" pasos:\n"

#. type: Bullet: '* '
#, markdown-text, no-wrap
msgid ""
"[Create a Virtual Private Cloud](https://cloud.ibm.com/docs/vpc?topic=vpc-"
"getting-started).\n"
msgstr ""
"[Crea una nube privada virtual](https://cloud.ibm.com/docs/vpc?topic=vpc-"
"getting-started).\n"

#. type: Bullet: '* '
#, markdown-text, no-wrap
msgid ""
"[Plan for the network topology](https://cloud.ibm.com/docs/vpc?topic=vpc-"
"planning-considerations) to connect to VPEs.\n"
msgstr ""
"[Planifica la topología de red](https://cloud.ibm.com/docs/vpc?topic=vpc-"
"planning-considerations) para conectarte a los VPE.\n"

#. type: Bullet: '* '
#, markdown-text, no-wrap
msgid ""
"[Set access controls](https://cloud.ibm.com/docs/vpc?topic=vpc-configure-"
"acls-sgs-endpoint-gateways) for your VPE.\n"
msgstr ""
"[Configura los controles de "
"acceso](https://cloud.ibm.com/docs/vpc?topic=vpc-configure-acls-sgs-"
"endpoint-gateways) para tu VPE.\n"

#. type: Bullet: '* '
#, markdown-text, no-wrap
msgid ""
"Understand the [limitations](https://cloud.ibm.com/docs/vpc?topic=vpc-"
"limitations-vpe) of having a VPE.\n"
msgstr ""
"Comprende las [limitaciones](https://cloud.ibm.com/docs/vpc?topic=vpc-"
"limitations-vpe) de tener un VPE.\n"

#. type: Bullet: '* '
#, markdown-text, no-wrap
msgid ""
"Understand how to [view VPE "
"details](https://cloud.ibm.com/docs/vpc?topic=vpc-vpe-viewing-details-of-an-"
"endpoint-gateway).\n"
msgstr ""
"Aprende a [ver los detalles del "
"VPE](https://cloud.ibm.com/docs/vpc?topic=vpc-vpe-viewing-details-of-an-"
"endpoint-gateway).\n"

#. type: Title ##
#, markdown-text, no-wrap
msgid ""
"Set up a VPE for IBM Quantum Platform {#set-up-a-vpe-for-ibm-quantum-"
"platform}"
msgstr ""
"Configurar un VPE para IBM Quantum Platform {#set-up-a-vpe-for-ibm-quantum-"
"platform}"

#. type: Plain text
#, markdown-text, no-wrap
msgid ""
"There are several ways to create a VPE gateway. If you use the "
"[CLI](https://cloud.ibm.com/docs/vpc?topic=vpc-vpc-"
"reference&interface=cli#vpe-clis) or "
"[API](https://cloud.ibm.com/apidocs/vpc/latest#create-endpoint-gateway), you"
" must specify the [Cloud Resource Name "
"(CRN)](https://cloud.ibm.com/docs/account?topic=account-crn) of the region "
"in which you want connect to IBM Quantum Platform. Review the following "
"table for the available regions and CRNs.\n"
msgstr ""
"Hay varias formas de crear un gateway VPE. Si usas la "
"[CLI](https://cloud.ibm.com/docs/vpc?topic=vpc-vpc-"
"reference&interface=cli#vpe-clis) o la "
"[API](https://cloud.ibm.com/apidocs/vpc/latest#create-endpoint-gateway), "
"debes especificar el [Nombre de recurso en la nube "
"(CRN)](https://cloud.ibm.com/docs/account?topic=account-crn) de la región en"
" la que deseas conectarte a IBM Quantum Platform. Consulta la siguiente "
"tabla para ver las regiones y CRN disponibles.\n"

#. type: Plain text
#, markdown-text, no-wrap
msgid ""
"| Region | Plans   | Fully Qualified Domain Name (FDQN) | Cloud Resource Name (CRN) |\n"
"|-----------------|-----------------|-----------------|-----------------|\n"
"| `us-east` | `Standard` | `private.us-east.quantum.cloud.ibm.com` | `crn:v1:bluemix:public:quantum-computing:us-east:::endpoint:private.us-east.quantum.cloud.ibm.com` |\n"
"| `eu-de` | `Standard` | `private.eu-de.quantum.cloud.ibm.com` | `crn:v1:bluemix:public:quantum-computing:eu-de:::endpoint:private.eu-de.quantum.cloud.ibm.com` |\n"
msgstr ""
"| Región | Planes   | Nombre de dominio completamente calificado (FDQN) | Nombre de recurso en la nube (CRN) |\n"
"|-----------------|-----------------|-----------------|-----------------|\n"
"| `us-east` | `Standard` | `private.us-east.quantum.cloud.ibm.com` | `crn:v1:bluemix:public:quantum-computing:us-east:::endpoint:private.us-east.quantum.cloud.ibm.com` |\n"
"| `eu-de` | `Standard` | `private.eu-de.quantum.cloud.ibm.com` | `crn:v1:bluemix:public:quantum-computing:eu-de:::endpoint:private.eu-de.quantum.cloud.ibm.com` |\n"

#. type: Title ###
#, markdown-text, no-wrap
msgid "Configuring an endpoint gateway {#configuring-an-endpoint-gateway}"
msgstr "Configurar un gateway de endpoint {#configuring-an-endpoint-gateway}"

#. type: Plain text
#, markdown-text, no-wrap
msgid "To configure a VPE gateway, follow these steps:\n"
msgstr "Para configurar un gateway VPE, sigue estos pasos:\n"

#. type: Bullet: '1. '
#, markdown-text, no-wrap
msgid ""
"List the available services, including IBM Cloud infrastructure services "
"available (by default) for all VPC users.\n"
msgstr ""
"Lista los servicios disponibles, incluidos los servicios de infraestructura "
"de IBM Cloud disponibles (de forma predeterminada) para todos los usuarios "
"de VPC.\n"

#. type: Bullet: '1. '
#, markdown-text, no-wrap
msgid ""
"[Create an endpoint gateway](https://cloud.ibm.com/docs/vpc?topic=vpc-"
"ordering-endpoint-gateway) for IBM Quantum Platform that you want to be "
"privately available to the VPC.\n"
msgstr ""
"[Crea un gateway de endpoint](https://cloud.ibm.com/docs/vpc?topic=vpc-"
"ordering-endpoint-gateway) para IBM Quantum Platform que desees que esté "
"disponible de forma privada en la VPC.\n"

#. type: Bullet: '1. '
#, markdown-text, no-wrap
msgid ""
"[Bind a reserved IP address](https://cloud.ibm.com/docs/vpc?topic=vpc-bind-"
"unbind-reserved-ip) to the endpoint gateway.\n"
msgstr ""
"[Vincula una dirección IP "
"reservada](https://cloud.ibm.com/docs/vpc?topic=vpc-bind-unbind-reserved-ip)"
" al gateway de endpoint.\n"

#. type: Bullet: '1. '
#, markdown-text, no-wrap
msgid ""
"[View the created VPE gateways](https://cloud.ibm.com/docs/vpc?topic=vpc-"
"vpe-viewing-details-of-an-endpoint-gateway) associated with IBM Quantum "
"Platform.\n"
msgstr ""
"[Consulta los gateways VPE "
"creados](https://cloud.ibm.com/docs/vpc?topic=vpc-vpe-viewing-details-of-an-"
"endpoint-gateway) asociados con IBM Quantum Platform.\n"

#. type: Plain text
#, markdown-text, no-wrap
msgid ""
"Now your virtual server instances in the VPC can access your IBM Quantum "
"Platform instance privately.\n"
msgstr ""
"Ahora las instancias de servidor virtual en la VPC pueden acceder a tu "
"instancia de IBM Quantum Platform de forma privada.\n"

#. type: Title ##
#, markdown-text, no-wrap
msgid ""
"Use your VPE for IBM Quantum Platform {#use-your-vpe-for-ibm-quantum-"
"platform}"
msgstr ""
"Usar tu VPE para IBM Quantum Platform {#use-your-vpe-for-ibm-quantum-"
"platform}"

#. type: Plain text
#, markdown-text, no-wrap
msgid ""
"After you create an endpoint gateway for IBM Quantum Platform, follow these "
"steps:\n"
msgstr ""
"Después de crear un gateway de endpoint para IBM Quantum Platform, sigue "
"estos pasos:\n"

#. type: Title ###
#, markdown-text, no-wrap
msgid ""
"Use the VPE with `qiskit-ibm-runtime` (Python SDK) {#use-the-vpe-with-"
"qiskit-ibm-runtime-python-sdk}"
msgstr ""
"Usar el VPE con `qiskit-ibm-runtime` (SDK de Python) {#use-the-vpe-with-"
"qiskit-ibm-runtime-python-sdk}"

#. type: Plain text
#, markdown-text, no-wrap
msgid ""
"<Admonition type=\"note\">\n"
"VPE support requires `qiskit-ibm-runtime` v0.24.0 or later.\n"
"</Admonition>\n"
msgstr ""
"<Admonition type=\"note\">\n"
"La compatibilidad con VPE requiere `qiskit-ibm-runtime` v0.24.0 o posterior.\n"
"</Admonition>\n"

#. type: Plain text
#, markdown-text, no-wrap
msgid ""
"When instantiating `QiskitRuntimeService`, specify "
"`private_endpoint=True`.\n"
msgstr ""
"Al instanciar `QiskitRuntimeService`, especifica `private_endpoint=True`.\n"

#. type: Title ###
#, markdown-text, no-wrap
msgid ""
"Use the VPE with the IBM Quantum API {#use-the-vpe-with-the-ibm-quantum-api}"
msgstr ""
"Usar el VPE con la API de IBM Quantum {#use-the-vpe-with-the-ibm-quantum-"
"api}"

#. type: Plain text
#, markdown-text, no-wrap
msgid ""
"After creating an endpoint gateway for IBM Quantum Platform, use the service"
" endpoint's FQDN for the target region.\n"
msgstr ""
"Después de crear un gateway de endpoint para IBM Quantum Platform, usa el "
"FQDN del endpoint del servicio para la región de destino.\n"
